  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"h1-custom-style\"><h1>ASME 規範暖通膨脹罐 | 美國 ASME 認證商用壓力容器 | AQUASKY 溢康企業</h1></div><div id=\"pd-container-01\" class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"pd-aquasky-text\"><div class=\"h1-1\"><img src=\"/images/products/ELBI/ELBI_logo.png\" class=\"img-responsive\" alt=\"PUMPLUS Pressure Tank\"></div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h2_2hline lang_rtl\">ASME等級的密閉式膨脹水箱壓力桶：確保系統穩定運行</h2>\n\t    <div class=\"pd-about-text txt-align-justify lang_rtl\">ASME等級的密閉式膨脹水箱壓力桶可用於冰水或熱水系統，吸收因系統溫度變化的水體積，並提供系統基本設定壓力。\r\n密閉式膨脹水箱是依據美國機械工程師學會訂定的ASME嚴格標準製作。</div>\n\n        <div id=\"ImgAutoResponsive\" class=\"lang_rtl\">\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/upfile/Images/ELBI/20231011_ELBI-Tank(DL-CE_ASME)-DM_CH_02.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\"></p>        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\t<div id=\"pd-more-info\" class=\"container\">\n    \t<h2 class=\"h2_2hline h2_2hline_margin lang_rtl\">產品系列</h2>\n\n<div id=\"other_pd_line\" class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"row padding_top_40\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n\t<img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-plus2.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"PUMPLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/PUMPLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">泵浦壓力桶</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n  \t<img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-mega2-2022.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"MEGA-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/MEGA-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">高壓泵浦壓力桶</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row padding_top_40\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n  \t<img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-thermal2.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"THERMAL-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/THERMAL-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">密閉式膨脹水箱</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-rot2.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"RO-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/RO-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">RO逆滲透儲水桶</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row padding_top_40\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-hydro2.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"HYDRO-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/HYDRO-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">導熱液體膨脹罐</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-solar2.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"SOLAR-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/SOLAR-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">太陽能液體膨脹罐</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row padding_top_40\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n  \t<img src=\"/images/products_line/pdg-premiumplus.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"PREMIUM-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/PREMIUM-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">不鏽鋼泵浦壓力桶</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/LQCOLPLUS_pdlline1.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"LQCOL-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/LQCOL-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">液冷系統膨脹水箱</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row padding_top_40\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/WEB_PRODUCT_LINE_GIGAPLUS.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"GIGA-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/GIGA-PLUS\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">高壓泵浦壓力桶</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/Elbi_B2022.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"LARGE SIZE DL TANK\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/dl-ce\" class=\"btn btn-link2\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">工業式密閉膨脹水箱</a> <a href=\"/zh/asme-ht\" class=\"btn btn-link2\" style=\"padding-top:2px;padding-bottom:2px;margin-bottom:5px;\">ASME認證<br>工業式密閉膨脹水箱</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row padding_top_40\">\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/SupremePlus_2023B.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"SUPREME-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/supreme\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">經濟型工業式密閉膨脹水箱</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n    <img src=\"/images/products_line/accessories3.webp\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"ACCESSORIES-PLUS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n    \t<a href=\"/zh/accessories\" class=\"btn btn-link2\">安裝配件</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"pd-spacing-01\"></div>\n</div>\t</div>\n</div>"
